#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Kabel designs and manufactures smart water appliances in Dayawan, Huizhou — and builds them under other people’s brands. Retail chains, distributors, hotel groups and e-commerce brands come to us for one-stop OEM/ODM production: household instant-heat taps for family kitchens, high-duty systems for offices, safe-temperature units for education and medical facilities, and wall-mounted or built-in units for hotel and engineering projects."
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "One team covers the whole program — requirement analysis, industrial design, spec engineering, sampling and testing, ISO 9001 production, export packaging and after-delivery support. You bring the brand and the market; we bring the platforms, the factory and the engineers."
msgstr ""

