#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "What is the minimum order quantity?"
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Most series start at 100 units for OEM customization; standard models can be trialed in smaller quantities."
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "How long does customization take?"
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Typically 4–6 weeks from spec confirmation to shipment, depending on certification scope."
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Can you develop a fully custom product, or only rebrand existing models?"
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Both. Most programs start from a proven platform — instant-heat, ice-water, sparkling or filtration — and customize appearance, parameters and packaging; ground-up ODM development is available with our in-house industrial design team."
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Which certifications do you support?"
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "ISO 9001 and BSCI factories, food-grade materials; CE/CB and market-specific schemes are handled per program."
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "How do we evaluate samples before committing to production?"
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Sample units ship with lab reports covering heating performance, flow rates and safety tests. For qualified programs, pilot-run units can be arranged so your team can validate the product in-market before mass production."
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "What does the warranty cover?"
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Every OEM program includes a one-year warranty from shipment. Claims are handled with replacement parts or units, coordinated through your account engineer."
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Are spare parts available after delivery?"
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Yes. Serviceable module sets and key spare parts are listed at spec confirmation, so your service team knows exactly what to stock for after-sales support."
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Which payment terms do you accept?"
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Common terms are T/T and L/C at sight; the exact deposit-and-balance split is agreed per program before production starts."
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Do you ship by sea or by air?"
msgstr ""

#: page-templates/services.php
msgid "Both. Sea freight in export cartons is standard for full programs; air freight is available for samples and urgent pilot runs. Export documents are handled by our team."
msgstr ""

